# Production / static-export build configuration (next build / build:static; next dev does not load this file).
#
# Leaving NEXT_PUBLIC_SSE_BASE empty -> SSE (EventSource) uses a [same-origin relative path] instead of a hardcoded :8787.
# The static export is always served same-origin by Go (dev machine connects directly to :8787 / production via nginx :80, :8090),
# and same-origin can flush SSE correctly; the reverse proxy already has proxy_buffering off. If the default :8787 is kept, under a
# reverse-proxy deployment the browser would try to connect to :8787 (bound to 127.0.0.1 only), which is unreachable from the public internet -> real-time streams such as logs come back empty.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SSE_BASE=
